      "output": "11-13,15-19",
      "formula": null,
      "text": "Read: with CS1 low, CS2 high, OE low and WE high the addressed word is driven on I/O1-I/O8. The outputs are high impedance when CS1 is high, CS2 is low, OE is high or WE is low."
    }
