    "read": "CS1 low, CS2 high, WE high, OE low: data valid tACC after address, tCO1/tCO2 after chip select, tOE after OE.",
    "write": "CS1 low, CS2 high and WE low overlap; the write ends at the first of WE high, CS1 high or CS2 low (write cycles 1-3). Data set up tDS before and held tDH after the end of write.",
